---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Run basic checks (media engine, config present, camera ports reachable)

Usage: qam doctor [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --probe[=<probe>]
          Probe each RTSP URL briefly
      --config <path>
          Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --rtsp-auth <rtsp-auth>
          RTSP auth mode: auto|basic|digest [default: auto]
      --rtsp-transport <rtsp-transport>
          RTSP transport: tcp|udp (probe) [default: tcp]
      --timeout <timeout>
          Dial timeout per camera [default: 2s]
  -h, --help
          Print help
